Decko TypeScript port
=====================

Copyright (C) 2026 The Decko TS port contributors

This program is a modified version of Decko. It was modified in 2026 by The
Decko TS port contributors, starting from Decko card 1.110.0 and decko 0.20.0:
the Ruby card engine and the parts of its mods this project covers were ported
to TypeScript, and the port was extended to run on Node and edge hosts. The
reference runtime for its comparisons is Decko on Ruby 3.2.3 on the project's
Linux VM, where the synthetic-v1 recorded Ruby outputs were captured on
2026-11-03; EVIDENCE.md states the reference each quoted result used.
It is not an upstream Decko release.

