### Compiled bundles inside the reference-harness fixture decks

The fixture decks `reference-harness/fixtures/synthetic-v1/` and
`reference-harness/fixtures/write-battery-v1/` store their compiled site
script (`deck/files/307/*.js`) and stylesheet (`deck/files/447/*.css`) as
card content. These are concatenations of the `fixtures/vendor/` components
above, including TinyMCE (LGPL-2.1) and Bootstrap Colorpicker (Apache-2.0).
`reference-harness/fixtures/DECK-BUNDLE-PROVENANCE.md` maps every
third-party component in them to its license text.


